{"data": [{"author_id": "2097963338416439296", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:40:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117491995644166204"], "id": "2117491995644166204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "摩根大通 中国股票策略：央行与证监会举措——非重炮，但底部更坚实\n\n主要观点\n政策制定者明确释放支持股票市场的信号，第三次证券、基金、保险公司互换便利（SFISF）操作预计提供增量流动性，回购规则修改有助于解决投资者对股东回报的担忧。", "url": "https://x.com/Bangbangliycll/status/2117491995644166204"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:28:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117443888017461271"], "id": "2117443888017461271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 270, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 开盘速报 | 低开近1%后深V拉回，创业板翻红，银行油气挨闷棍（11.3）\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2117443888017461271"}, {"author_id": "3302713589", "created_at": "2026-11-03T06:09:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117499330294931672"], "id": "2117499330294931672", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 234, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股三大指数早盘集体下跌，截至午盘，上证指数跌0.71%，深证成指跌0.16%，创业板指跌0.94%，北证50跌1.9%，科创50指数跌2.54%。全市场成交额9996亿元，较上日缩量1478亿元，全市场超3300只个股上涨。", "url": "https://x.com/Maksek1234/status/2117499330294931672"}, {"author_id": "2075059630796058624", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:19:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117456676941172863"], "id": "2117456676941172863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天创业板ETF易方达的成交额直接破百，这波市场情绪是不是有点过热了？宽基ETF里上证50ETF的成交量更是暴涨189%，这背后到底藏着什么故事？别告诉我这只是巧合！", "url": "https://x.com/JohnUKtfnr/status/2117456676941172863"}, {"author_id": "1301751781056151553", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:46:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117463291786362930"], "id": "2117463291786362930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "上证午盘收3612，跌0.71%，\n科创50直接−2.54%，创业板−0.94%。半日成交9926亿。\n涨跌家数：涨3186、跌1974，多数票是红的。\n指数绿、个股红。\n\n资金方向：\n-- 电子主力净流出81.7亿，半导体流出51.4亿，通信设备流出41亿\n-- 中际旭创−8.5%、寒武纪−7.9%、新易盛−4.6%，成交额前排一片绿\n--", "url": "https://x.com/lefeiren129/status/2117463291786362930"}, {"author_id": "1952553799777923072", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:22:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117472222625546531", "2117472442885312728"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qEJmzEZ392", "end": 191, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhuailcz/status/2117472442885312728/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117472212877967360", "start": 168, "url": "https://t.co/qEJmzEZ392"}]}, "id": "2117472442885312728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 362, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A 股午间收盘消息 (11.03 午间) \n11.03 A 股午间收盘速报 | 指数分化 热点快速轮动 \n三大指数集体收跌科创领跌，中船系、锂电、文化传媒板块走强，银行、油气、算力硬件集体调整\n\n📊 A 股主要指数\n ▼ 上证指数 -0.71% \n ▼ 深证成指 -0.16%\n ▼ 创业板指 -0.94%\n ▼ 科创综指 -2.8% https://t.co/qEJmzEZ392", "url": "https://x.com/zhuailcz/status/2117472442885312728"}, {"author_id": "1708855658068742144", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:59:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117406190854377691"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 0, "tag": "A股盘前复盘"}, {"end": 13, "start": 8, "tag": "短线主线"}, {"end": 19, "start": 14, "tag": "政策利好"}, {"end": 25, "start": 20, "tag": "科技成长"}]}, "id": "2117406190854377691", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 761, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股盘前复盘 #短线主线 #政策利好 #科技成长\n\n11.3盘前必读：千亿互换便利落地，AI应用全线爆发，大盘高开分化，是延续反弹还是冲高兑现？\n\n开盘前核心信息梳理。行情不能只看消息面，必须结合技术、资金与情绪综合判断。", "url": "https://x.com/Khoibin00/status/2117406190854377691"}, {"author_id": "1952553799777923072", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:21:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117472222625546531", "2117472442885312728"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 24, "start": 22, "tag": "A"}, {"end": 33, "start": 28, "tag": "午盘复盘"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/WmBWWQui7T", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhuailcz/status/2117472222625546531/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117472212877967360", "start": 177, "url": "https://t.co/WmBWWQui7T"}]}, "id": "2117472222625546531", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A 股午间收盘消息 (11.03 午间) \n#A 股# #午盘复盘 # \n11.03 A 股午间收盘速报 | 指数分化 热点快速轮动 \n三大指数集体收跌科创领跌，中船系、锂电、文化传媒板块走强，银行、油气、算力硬件集体调整\n\n📊 A 股主要指数\n ▼ 上证指数 -0.71% \n ▼ 深证成指 -0.16%\n ▼ 创业板指 -0.94%\n ▼ 科创综指 https://t.co/WmBWWQui7T", "url": "https://x.com/zhuailcz/status/2117472222625546531"}, {"author_id": "1978001990828625920", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:45:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117463110554624139"], "id": "2117463110554624139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "早盘 A 股看似指数全绿，但扒开 ETF 的资金底牌，主力正在上演极其剧烈的“高低大腾挪”\n\n表面上看，科创 50 大跌 2.54%，“易中天”光模块低迷直接把通信 ETF、科创成长 ETF 砸跌超 4%，连同昨晚原油跳水把标普油气 ETF 干跌了 6.22%。\n\n但如果你只盯着指数看，就完全漏掉了盘面真正的暗流：\n1️⃣", "url": "https://x.com/jiangtao0628/status/2117463110554624139"}, {"author_id": "2047487856634187777", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:54:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117480623199953043"], "id": "2117480623199953043", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 985, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【午评:科创50指数半日跌2.54% AI漫剧概念股集体走强】", "url": "https://x.com/ixyue29/status/2117480623199953043"}, {"author_id": "2113175438508089344", "created_at": "2026-11-03T06:21:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117502450815168557"], "id": "2117502450815168557", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股午后下跌不只在科技股。14:12沪指跌1.34%、深成指跌1.56%、创业板指跌3.00%；14:17北证50跌4.03%。\n\n前一条看的是算力硬件，现在几条主要指数的跌幅也在扩大。这里只是盘中截面，不能把指数全绿等同于所有个股都跌；收盘还要核对涨跌家数和成交额。\n\nThe afternoon decline widened across major", "url": "https://x.com/xietspm/status/2117502450815168557"}, {"author_id": "2113175438508089344", "created_at": "2026-11-03T06:03:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117497875563495832"], "id": "2117497875563495832", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "午后科技股跌势比午盘更重了：13:33创业板指盘中跌破2400点、跌2.6%；13:34中际旭创跌11.11%，成交额已到200亿元。\n\n午盘我还在看算力硬件能否止跌，现在这组盘中数据给出的答案是暂时没有。后面看收盘能否收回，别把盘中价当成收盘。\n\nTech selling intensified after lunch; the closing picture is", "url": "https://x.com/xietspm/status/2117497875563495832"}, {"author_id": "243124464", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:58:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117481595879948704"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PHZvXQMEnh", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iJimmyChan/status/2117481595879948704/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117481390346559488", "start": 112, "url": "https://t.co/PHZvXQMEnh"}]}, "id": "2117481595879948704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股午盘：指数在跌，但算力链跌得最重，消费和电气设备在接力。\n\n11月3日午间：沪指3612.09点（-0.71%），创业板指2435.60点（-0.94%），科创综指-2.80%，沪深半日成交额约4644亿+5282亿。 https://t.co/PHZvXQMEnh", "url": "https://x.com/iJimmyChan/status/2117481595879948704"}, {"author_id": "1749597659902713856", "created_at": "2026-11-03T06:29:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117504433240363440"], "id": "2117504433240363440", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6252, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11月3日午后，A股AI硬件板块集体重挫：创业板指盘中跌破2400点，科创50指数跌超4%，CPO龙头中际旭创成交额放大到200亿元、跌幅一度超过11%，寒武纪、沐曦等算力芯片股跌超7%；港股AI概念同步走弱，台湾加权指数收跌3.6%，较10月高点回撤约13%。", "url": "https://x.com/bytelee_trade/status/2117504433240363440"}, {"author_id": "1659674300272758786", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:16:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117485950334824809"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 7, "start": 4, "tag": "午盘"}, {"end": 11, "start": 8, "tag": "经济"}]}, "id": "2117485950334824809", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 885, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #午盘 #经济 \n\n算力硬件遭血洗！科创50重挫，资金疯狂抄底“新能源”\n \n【大A主理人 午盘直击】\n \n上午收盘，看一眼盘面，大白话总结：指数看着吓人，但其实是资金的“大搬家”。\n \n上证跌0.71%，科创50更是重挫2.54%。为什么跌？成也算力，败也算力。", "url": "https://x.com/Uringuyen0211/status/2117485950334824809"}, {"author_id": "1952878215279648768", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:34:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117430259801043122"], "id": "2117430259801043122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "昨日A股完成近1.8万亿量级的放量修复，隔夜全球资产定价结构出现明显分化。\n\n纳指收跌、费城半导体大幅调整，亚太股指同步承压。\n\n海外硬件估值压缩的背景下，内资筹码再分配路径，将是早盘核心观测主线。\n\n一、全球资产全景矩阵\n\n1.利率与汇率定价锚", "url": "https://x.com/RichardNel9129/status/2117430259801043122"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2097963338416439296", "name": "浑水股报", "username": "Bangbangliycll"}, {"id": "1996551578187436033", "name": "人类股市观察家", "username": "YoooJJ8cm"}, {"id": "3302713589", "name": "股市老总韩韩", "username": "Maksek1234"}, {"id": "2075059630796058624", "name": "John UK", "username": "JohnUKtfnr"}, {"id": "1301751781056151553", "name": "小楽子", "username": "lefeiren129"}, {"id": "1952553799777923072", "name": "李知道", "username": "zhuailcz"}, {"id": "1708855658068742144", "name": "擒龙逍遥子", "username": "Khoibin00"}, {"id": "1978001990828625920", "name": "达子聊AI", "username": "jiangtao0628"}, {"id": "2047487856634187777", "name": "智者等抄底", "username": "ixyue29"